=== Geotag ===
Contributors: Boris Pulyer
Donate link: http://www.bobsp.de/
Tags: geotag, geo, map, google, geocode, coordinates, position, kml, kmz, exif, georss, streetview, google maps
Requires at least: 3.0.0
Tested up to: 3.1.1
Stable tag: 2.0

Provides geocoding features for your Wordpress blog.

== Description ==

With Geotag you can add your position to your posts and display maps with the position of your posts, your photos and with KML/KMZ files. The plugin has lots of options to configure and uses the latest Google Maps API (v3) with Streetview.

= Features =

* **Save your position** with your posts.
* Add one or more **interactive maps** to your posts or pages with **Streetview**.
* Display **KML/KMZ files** with your route, your waypoints or your photos.
* Read the geotags from the **exif header** of the photos of your post and show them.
* Can be configured individually for every post.
* Perfect for **blogging via email** as you may set the coordinates and options in the text of the post.
* **Merge Markers** which are close to each other.
* Supports the **Google Marker Manager** to display huge amounts of markers.
* Uses a modified **timthumb** for creating and caching thumbnails.
* Adds a special tab to your **Media Upload Window** for processing KML/KMZ files.
* One-file-design makes it easy to costumize the plugin.
* Pic up your location by a click on the map or by searching for an address.
* Costumize your map style.
* Supports **querys to display multiple posts** in one map.
* Supports static maps for higher speed.
* **Adds maps automatically** or by using a shortcode within the text of the post.
* Supports **different geographic coordinate conversions**.
* Add geotags to your **feeds or HTML header**.
* Documentation.

